Mon Nov 16 20:32:55 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.4.3:
  * 0.4.1: custom model-path arguments with provenance, Intel
    WDDM activity, NVIDIA TCC-mode GPUs on Windows, Foundry Local
    models on Snapdragon, Qualcomm shared RAM, Windows driver
    version from PnP and integrated-GPU memory fixes.
  * 0.4.2: vLLM request and KV-cache gauges plus llama-server
    KV-cache and concurrency from /metrics, AMD GPUs in WSL via
    ROCm, record summary and offline replay, Xe fdinfo memory
    and GT frequency/throttle readings, integer percents.
  * 0.4.3: Windows Intel/Qualcomm device line shows GPU percent
    with one reason instead of all-N/A; JSON unchanged.
  * Handy Windows path backslash fix for Python 3.11.
- Add linkify-it-py to Requires: help screen ('?') crashed with
  ModuleNotFoundError without it (boo#1290249).

