Wed Nov 11 12:58:00 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.4.0:
  * Intel whole-GPU load, video load and power readings
    (root only).
  * New Huawei Ascend NPU backend (310P) on Linux.
  * Fixed vLLM topology flag values being evaluated before skipping
    API discovery.

